{
  "id": 189822409,
  "iid": 8907,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "mongo: add Checksum field",
  "description": "# Summary\nAdd Checksum field to OP_MSG dissector.\n\nResolves https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/18659\n\n# Background\n\nhttps://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/4ecad751532c5a04a8a8febb4b4f829f71e2e3c8/src/mongo/rpc/op_msg.cpp#L74-L84 describes the calculation of the checksum. The entire OP_MSG is included in the calculation.\n\nChecksum in MongoDB is CRC32C with seed 0xFFFFFFFF: https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/4ecad751532c5a04a8a8febb4b4f829f71e2e3c8/src/third_party/wiredtiger/src/checksum/software/checksum.c#L582\n\nChecksum dissection was copied from https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-iscsi.c#L652\n\nTo manually test:\n- [one-with-checksum.pcap](/uploads/8ae3b607662dd4058003df27b3536eed/one-with-checksum.pcap) contains one OP_MSG with a good checksum.\n- [one-with-bad-checksum.pcap](/uploads/81e5deb5ffb622eec2690e18ff760913/one-with-bad-checksum.pcap) contains one OP_MSG with a good checksum.\n- [no-checksums.pcapng](/uploads/96fbd07649b89b5315479d1a2e44e040/no-checksums.pcapng) contains OP_MSG packets with no checksums.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2022-11-21T00:52:15.796Z",
